#[navbar]

#[section, $md:
    @../ (Codebase) / Compiler-facing language reference

    # Compiler-facing language reference

    Compiler changes should start from the language contract. The unsuffixed
    references listed below own syntax, semantics, edge cases and deferred
    language surfaces.
]

#[section, $md:
    ## Canonical references

    Each public route groups the references for one language area.

    Foundations:

    - @../../language-overview (Language basics)
    - @../../bindings (Values and bindings)
    - @../../numbers (Numbers)
    - @../../casts (Casts)

    Functions and control flow:

    - @../../functions (Functions)
    - @../../branching (Branching)
    - @../../loops (Loops)
    - @../../errors (Errors, options and assertions)

    Data and compile-time construction:

    - @../../structs (Structs)
    - @../../choices (Choices)
    - @../../collections (Collections and maps)
    - @../../templates (Templates)
    - @../../constants (Constants and compile-time behaviour)

    Names and static abstraction:

    - @../../aliases (Aliases)
    - @../../generics (Generics)
    - @../../traits (Traits)

    UI state:

    - @../../reactivity (Reactivity)

    Projects and imported content:

    - @../../project-structure (Project structure)
    - @../../packages (Packages and imports)
    - @../../moth-templates (Moth template files)
    - @../../markdown (Plain Markdown)

    Each route combines a Basic teaching layer with detailed Advanced
    references. The unsuffixed Moth template files form the canonical language
    authority. Basic files and route introductions teach that contract without
    replacing it.
]

#[section, $md:
    ## Reference map

    `docs/src/docs/codebase/language/overview.mtf` lists every canonical file and
    routes formal compiler, build and memory ownership.
]

#[section, $md:
    ## Related design

    - @../design-scope (Design scope): accepted mechanisms and intentionally excluded complexity
    - @../memory-management/access-and-aliasing (Access and aliasing): shared reads, explicit copies and exclusive access
    - @../compiler-design (Compiler design overview): stage ownership and cross-stage data flow
    - @../../progress (Progress matrix): current implementation support and known gaps
]

#[section, $md:
    ## More documentation

    See @../../ (All documentation) for tutorials, examples and feature-focused language pages.
]
